# Project 7 keeps its final progress.md as the observability proof.

# Keep the normal scheduled Project 7 beat, not the copied Project 3 briefs.
briefs/*
!briefs/2026-09-11-beat-8.md

# Keep the Project 7 cron evidence despite the repository-wide *.log rule.
!cron.log

# Copied Project 3 runtime evidence is not part of the Project 7 proof.
cron-test.log

# Runtime-only state. Committing the consumed guard would prevent a fresh clone
# from running its own controlled failure attempt.
.project7-failure-attempted

# Generated caches and the archived prior attempt.
__pycache__/
_prev_agy_attempt/
